{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"西番雅書","commonName":"西番雅書","title":"西番雅書","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"4d1e9971ea998a363ca860048ef6d06977238fc9a10c7eaa9b21fe90af9c4689","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":52},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["當猶大王亞們的兒子約西亞在位的時候，耶和華的話臨到希西家的玄孫，亞瑪利雅的曾孫，基大利的孫子，古示的兒子西番雅。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華審判的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必從地上除滅萬類。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除滅人和牲畜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與空中的鳥、海裏的魚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及絆腳石和惡人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必將人從地上剪除。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我必伸手攻擊猶大","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和耶路撒冷的一切居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必從這地方剪除所剩下的巴力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並基瑪林的名和祭司，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與那些在房頂上敬拜天上萬象的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並那些敬拜耶和華指着他起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又指着瑪勒堪起誓的，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與那些轉去不跟從耶和華的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和不尋求耶和華也不訪問他的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你要在主耶和華面前靜默無聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的日子快到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已經預備祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將他的客分別為聖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了我－耶和華獻祭的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必懲罰首領和王子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並一切穿外邦衣服的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，我必懲罰一切跳過門檻、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將強暴和詭詐得來之物充滿主人房屋的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：當那日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從魚門必發出悲哀的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從二城發出哀號的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從山間發出大破裂的響聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪革提施的居民哪，你們要哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為迦南的商民都滅亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡搬運銀子的都被剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我必用燈巡查耶路撒冷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必懲罰那些如酒在渣滓上澄清的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們心裏說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必不降福，也不降禍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的財寶必成為掠物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的房屋必變為荒場。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必建造房屋，卻不得住在其內；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種葡萄園，卻不得喝所出的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華的大日臨近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臨近而且甚快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是耶和華日子的風聲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士必痛痛地哭號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日是忿怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是急難困苦的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是荒廢淒涼的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是黑暗幽冥、密雲烏黑的日子，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是吹角吶喊的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要攻擊堅固城和高大的城樓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我必使災禍臨到人身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們行走如同瞎眼的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為得罪了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的血必倒出如灰塵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的肉必拋棄如糞土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當耶和華發怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的金銀不能救他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的忿怒如火必燒滅全地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅這地的一切居民，而且大大毀滅。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEP/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HAB/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}